<title>JAPAN: JR West files 200 bln yen bond shelf registration.</title>
<headline>JR West files 200 bln yen bond shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Japan Railway Co (JR West) said on Friday that it had filed a shelf registration with the Finance Ministry to issue up to 200 billion yen worth of corporate bonds, effective for two years from December 5.</p>
</text>
